/* =========================================================================
   dummies.are — Training Hall
   Vnum range: 889000–89099 (rooms), 889001–889004 (mobs)

   Location: south from room 33100 (Guildmaster Hall, Solennir).
   A straight south corridor under the guild hall, one dummy per chamber.
   Each dummy isolates a single defensive stat — no mixed profiles.

   Layout:
     33100 Guildmaster Hall
       | (new south exit — added by patch_add_dummies_area.py)
     89000 The South Hall          (entry hub)
       |
     89001 The Resilience Chamber  (Hit Pillow   — 100k HP, no offense)
       |
     89002 The Bulwark Chamber     (Iron Maiden  — AC -1000)
       |
     89003 The Warded Chamber      (Warded One   — saves -200 all)
       |
     89004 The Arena Chamber       (The Slammer  — hitroll/damroll +100)

   All dummies: ACT_NOEXP ACT_NOLOOT ACT_SENTINEL. Reset each area tick.
   ========================================================================= */

#ROOMS

#89000
The South Hall~
   A wide stone corridor descends south beneath the Guildmaster Hall above.
Torchlight flickers from iron sconces along the walls. The air is cool and
quiet — a place built for discipline, not glory. Archways to the south lead
deeper into the training chambers.~
dummies~
0 0
D0
~
~
0 0 33100
D2
~
~
0 0 89001
S

#89001
The Resilience Chamber~
   A circular chamber hewn from dark stone, its walls reinforced with thick
iron bands. A massive training construct stands at the center, built to
absorb punishment without complaint. Fighters come here to measure their
raw output — nothing more, nothing less.~
dummies~
0 0
D0
~
~
0 0 89000
D2
~
~
0 0 89002
S

#89002
The Bulwark Chamber~
   The walls here are lined with layered plates of blackened steel, a tribute
to the art of armoring. A training construct in full plate stands motionless
at the center, its surface barely marked despite years of use. If your
strikes cannot find purchase here, your weapon skill needs work.~
