#89003
The Warded Chamber~
   Strange sigils are carved into every surface of this chamber — runes of
warding, deflection, and resistance. A construct stands at the center, its
form suffused with a faint shimmer. Spells and debuffs that would floor a
lesser target barely register here. This is where casters learn what saves
actually mean.~
