#MOBILES

/* -------------------------------------------------------------------------
   NOTE FOR CODE:
   Verify these stat line formats against an existing DS .are mobile.
   ROM .are mobile format varies between derivatives. In particular:
     - hp_dice format (XdY+Z vs flat +N)
     - saves line (some DS mobs use extended stat blocks)
     - act/aff flags — confirm ACT_NOEXP, ACT_NOLOOT, ACT_SENTINEL values
       from merc.h before trusting the numbers below.
   Reference: grep for a known working mob in solennir.are or midgaard.are
   and mirror the format exactly.
   ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

#89001
the hit pillow~
The Hit Pillow~
A massive reinforced training construct stands here, awaiting punishment.~
   It is an enormous padded construct, built from layers of hardened leather
and rope, reinforced at its core with iron. It shows no signs of aggression
and no signs of wear despite clearly having absorbed tremendous punishment.
A plaque at its base reads: 'Measure your output here.'~
dummies~
/* act_flags: SENTINEL(2) + NOEXP(?) + NOLOOT(?) — verify from merc.h */
8194 0 0 N
/* level hitroll AC hp */
101 0 100 0d0+100000 0d0+0
/* damage dice damtype */
0d0+0 0
/* position_start position_default gold exp */
8 8 0 0
human~

#89002
the iron maiden~
The Iron Maiden~
A training construct encased in layered blackened plate stands here.~
   It is a training construct armored in overlapping plates of blackened
steel, each layer fitted tightly against the last. It moves only slightly
when struck, absorbing the blow through sheer density of armor. A plaque
reads: 'If you cannot hit this, your weapon skill needs work.'~
dummies~
8194 0 0 N
/* level hitroll AC(−1000 = very high armor) hp */
101 5 -1000 0d0+10000 0d0+0
/* hits back lightly */
1d4+2 0
8 8 0 0
human~

#89003
the warded one~
The Warded One~
A shimmerering training construct stands here, wreathed in protective sigils.~
   It is a training construct covered in faintly glowing runes of warding
and deflection. Spells and debuffs seem to slide off its surface, diffused
by the layered magical resistance etched into its form. A plaque reads:
'If your debuffs fail here, the target's saves are beating you.'~
dummies~
8194 0 0 N
/* level hitroll AC hp — saves handled via extended stat block if DS supports */
101 5 0 0d0+10000 0d0+0
/* hits back lightly */
1d4+2 0
8 8 0 0
human~

#89004
the slammer~
The Slammer~
A brutish training construct looms here, its fists the size of anvils.~
   It is an enormous training construct built for one purpose: hitting as
hard as possible. Its strikes land with crushing precision, designed to
stress-test every defensive skill in the game. Fighters who survive a
session with it know exactly what their parry, dodge, and shield block
are worth. A plaque reads: 'Survive this. Then talk.'~
dummies~
8194 0 0 N
/* level hitroll(+100) AC hp */
101 100 0 0d0+10000 0d0+0
/* damroll+100 reflected here — verify damroll field position */
8d10+100 0
8 8 0 0
human~

